    "intro": {
      "zh": "Pac-Man 街机框体是南梦宫 1980 年推出的经典街机，黄色吃豆人在迷宫中追逐豆子、躲避幽灵的玩法风靡全球，开辟了角色 IP 与迷宫追逐类型。它是街机暗房「投币文化」与「角色 IP」叙事线的核心展品。",
      "en": "The Pac-Man arcade cabinet, released by Namco in 1980, became one of the most famous arcade machines in history, pioneering character IP and the maze-chase genre with its iconic yellow hero."
    },
    "era": 1980,
    "manufacturer": "Namco"
  },
